{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"心里悬了很久的期待，到这里终于先得到了满足\",\"source\":\"若还记得第32小节那次差一点抵达、却没能真正落定的高潮，这里又可以听出另一层：前面悬置已久的期待，终于得到了某种满足。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将其限定为一种可听出的解读，并用“某种”保留程度上的余地；屏幕稿则把期待得到满足写成了确定的心理事实。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"又像多年后重回旧屋，陈设没变，熟悉的温柔却多了新的重量\",\"source\":\"这次重逢，也像多年后重新走进一间旧房子。家具可能没变，可你知道的事情已经太多了。原来的温柔再次出现，却有了新的重量；而知道它有多珍贵以后，心里反而更容易发疼。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿说家具“可能没变”，保留了不确定性，屏幕稿改成“陈设没变”，将可能变成了确定。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "78200621-95f6-4379-9111-ad589bb2598d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T045326916929Z", "elapsed_seconds": 251.172, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T04:57:38.104839+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0fc42bd55e1d4298ae8fd20146ec2479f61c2d7ab50680388916227af886926a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc